# Agent routing (system wrapper)

**Repo entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). **Do not** treat [docs/roadmap.md](../../docs/roadmap.md) as the queue.

## User mode

| Mode | Work source | Code / cards |
| ---- | ----------- | ------------ |
| **Agent** (default) | **Kanban** `.devtool/features/` — To Do card path, id, or title | Follow [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md); ignore Backlog |
| **Ask** | User question | Read-only — no card moves, no edits unless user leaves Ask mode |

## Turn lifecycle

```text
START → agent-triage/SKILL.md (classify; §1b failure-pattern grep on signals only)
WORK  → card Label Paths + Label Methods (when Feature Areas set) OR surgical grep → minimal edit
        → Review QA fix: **QA follow-up** + refresh Feature Areas / Label Paths / Label Methods
          when scope changes (kanban-markdown § User-reported QA fixes)
VERIFY → targeted pytest; pre-commit-pytest.sh before Review/commit
DONE  → user says card Done → lessons learned capture (kanban-markdown § Card Done — lessons learned)
END   → agent-self-evaluation/SKILL.md + handoff block
```

**Implementation / fix / refactor:** edit **≥1** `.cursor/skills/*` and **≥1** `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` before handoff (different learnings — skill = workflow, rule = constraint).

## Kanban card type (read `labels` in frontmatter)

| Label | Rule | Agent plan section |
| ----- | ---- | ------------------ |
| `bug` | [kanban-bug-cards.mdc](kanban-bug-cards.mdc) | **Corrective Action** (not Decisions) |
| `commit-issue` | [kanban-commit-issue-cards.mdc](kanban-commit-issue-cards.mdc) | **Review** → Root Cause + Corrective Action; implement only after user approval |
| `inquiry` | [kanban-inquiry-cards.mdc](kanban-inquiry-cards.mdc) | **Response**; spawn **todo** + `epic` when user approves recommendations |
| `agent` | [kanban-agent-cards.mdc](kanban-agent-cards.mdc) | **Decisions**; user **Description** + **Feature Area** |
| *(feature)* | — | **Decisions** |

Resolve **Feature Areas** (or agent card **Feature Area**) → **Label Paths** + **Label Methods** via `docs/feature-areas.yaml` before `in-progress`.

## Code style (Python)

All agent edits to `.py` / `.pyi` files must keep lines ≤ **100** characters (`pyproject.toml` `line-length = 100`). Pre-commit ruff fails on E501 — wrap strings, split imports, break call chains before commit.

## Load skills (on demand — not all every turn)

| Touching | Read first |
| -------- | ---------- |
| Unfamiliar layout | [repo-map/SKILL.md](../skills/repo-map/SKILL.md) |
| Kanban card | [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) |
